<BaseLayout title="Shipping Policy | VIRELLAART">

<section class="policy-page">

<h1>Shipping Policy</h1>

<p>
VIRELLAART is a luxury furniture manufacturer based in Istanbul, Türkiye,
serving customers worldwide with carefully prepared international deliveries.
</p>

<h2>International Delivery</h2>

<p>
Our furniture collections are produced after order confirmation and prepared
for secure international transportation. Delivery times may vary depending on
destination country, product availability and shipping arrangements.
</p>

<h2>Packaging & Protection</h2>

<p>
Each product is professionally inspected and protected with specialized
packaging methods before shipment to ensure safe arrival.
</p>

<h2>Worldwide Shipping</h2>

<p>
VIRELLAART provides international shipping solutions for luxury residences,
private clients and interior projects worldwide.
</p>

<h2>Delivery Information</h2>

<p>
For detailed shipping costs, delivery time and destination information,
please contact our customer support team through WhatsApp.
</p>

</section>

</BaseLayout>